        "text_U6BBKW": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Crafted from high quality materials with smart storage compartments and an insulated section to store milk, this practical solution is a must-have for any pumping mom who values convenience, organization, and a bag with a spacious interior. Comparable to other breast pump bags, this stylish, portable carryall doubles as a regular bag or even a diaper bag, thanks to its multiple pockets and ample space inside for pump parts, baby essentials, and more. It’s also sleek enough to be carried as a tote or backpack alternative, making it a functional accessory that can truly enhance your day-to-day routine.</p>",
