        "text_zAC33L": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<ul><li>Designed to fit Ameda Mya Joy and Mya Joy PLUS, plus other standard breast pumps. Perfect for a double pump setup or single unit, so you have enough space for pump parts and accessories.</li><li>Thoughtfully organized interior with dedicated compartments for flanges, bottles, tubing, charger, and accessories. With multiple pouches like a diaper bag, it helps you stay organized and makes it easy to quickly find what you need.</li><li>Lightweight and compact for easy portability, whether you’re commuting to work or heading out for the day. A portable design that looks great, but functions even better as a pump bag.</li><li>Made from durable, easy-to-clean fabric that stands up to daily use.</li><li>High quality materials ensure longevity, and it’s simple to wipe down after a long day.</li><li>Built-in insulated compartment keeps expressed milk cool when used with ice packs (ice packs not included). Keep your baby’s milk fresher for longer—perfect for busy schedules and travel.</li><li>Stylish enough to use as an everyday bag, with the functionality to keep pumping essentials organized and accessible.</li></ul>",
            "enlarge_text": false
